@GiphyIntegration.api_HostAddress = https://localhost:7284

### Get trending GIF URLs
GET {{GiphyIntegration.api_HostAddress}}/api/GiphyIntegration/trending
Accept: application/json

### Search GIF URLs
GET {{GiphyIntegration.api_HostAddress}}/api/GiphyIntegration/search?q=cats
Accept: application/json
